    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        92.73468780517578,
        527.4057006835938,
        107.17768859863281
      ],
      "text": "Moving to decentralized, family-centred, integrated services requires careful planning and regular",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        105.93470001220703,
        527.4158325195312,
        120.37770080566406
      ],
      "text": "monitoring of implementation against the plan. The capacity needs of NTPs for implementing the",
