    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        119.13483428955078,
        352.1581115722656,
        133.5778350830078
      ],
      "text": "proposed interventions need to be identified and addressed.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        140.8386993408203,
        527.385986328125,
        155.2816925048828
      ],
      "text": "Enhanced data collection around child and adolescent TB potentially takes a substantial amount of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        154.03871154785156,
        527.4342041015625,
        168.48170471191406
      ],
      "text": "additional time and detailed data collection may only be feasible in specific operational research",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        167.2387237548828,
        527.2346801757812,
        181.6817169189453
      ],
      "text": "settings. Programmes generally have registers in place for contact investigation, treatment registration",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.967903137207031,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        180.43873596191406,
        527.4003295898438,
        194.88172912597656
      ],
      "text": "and outcomes, as well as TPT registers. The use of these (preferably electronic) tools is important",
