      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        193.6387481689453,
        527.455322265625,
        208.0817413330078
      ],
      "text": "as programmes move to a more decentralized and family-centred, integrated approach, to ensure",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        206.83863830566406,
        527.2086791992188,
        221.28163146972656
      ],
      "text": "comprehensive management and treatment. The use of these tools needs to be evaluated and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        220.0386505126953,
        304.9912109375,
        234.4816436767578
      ],
      "text": "enhanced, including through operational research.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        241.7425079345703,
        527.4246215820312,
        256.1855163574219
      ],
      "text": "It will be important to monitor the number of children diagnosed at different levels of the health",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        254.94264221191406,
        527.4322509765625,
        269.3856506347656
      ],
      "text": "system, including the proportion of children that have bacteriological confirmation, the proportion",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        268.142578125,
        527.3958129882812,
        282.5856018066406
      ],
      "text": "who were clinically diagnosed as well as the number of children initiated on and completing TPT.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
