      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        294.5426025390625,
        527.449951171875,
        308.9856262207031
      ],
      "text": "the quality of services (covering the quality of all steps in the patient pathway, from screening, to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        307.74249267578125,
        476.5604553222656,
        322.1855163574219
      ],
      "text": "diagnosis and treatment) as well as client satisfaction are important components as well.",
